# gradlew is a shell script: with CRLF (a Windows checkout, including the CI one that packs the template) it does not
# run on the Linux or macOS of whoever downloads the template. The .bat keeps CRLF, and the wrapper jar is binary.
# LF in every checkout, Windows too: the formatter and .editorconfig expect it, and scripts need it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
*.png binary
